[For "white"]
[Kind "rare"]
[Start "london-main 1.d4"]
[Name "1...c5: the Old Benoni"]

1... c5 { The one first move the system does not meet in the usual way. }
2. d5 { Against 1...c5 White does not need the bishop: the pawn pushes past with space, and Black's c-pawn no longer hits anything. }
2... Nf6
3. Nc3
3... d6
4. e4 { Builds the big centre. [%idea centre-pawns] }
4... g6
5. Nf3
5... Bg7
6. Be2
6... O-O
7. O-O { The pawns on d5 and e4 cramp Black's pieces, and the king is safe. } *
